docs.body:
README.md and docs/DEVELOPMENT.md say so, and DEVELOPMENT.md names the embedding library the build uses,
@huggingface/transformers. The comment on the index's content field no longer calls it the text search reads, and
coverage counts scripts/search-index.mjs beside the two other .mjs modules it names.

